# About



TOI (The Outer Inn) Sector is my personal gemini capsule, heavily themed after the tabletop roleplaying game Paranoia (by Mongoose Publishing). 

IRL I'm a diehard GenX'er who lives in the unforgiving Wyoming high deserts, I work mornings in a small PT clinic (after a career in IT), and spend the rest of the hours working on my computers, TTRPGs, and keeping small-net rooms lit. I'm a former Army Paratrooper (infantry) who till considers my oath against enemies both foreign and domestic unexpired. Chaotic Good by nature, with an ancestral lineage that includes a pirate flag. Deus vult. ✝️

There's no tracking here, no comments section full of frothing at the mouth retards. There's no newsletter popups, ads, and Zuckerborg certainly doesn't control the content. 🚫

If you need, the mailbox is homeworlds at pm dot me.

